  "title": "Search And Replace String — offset",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Search And Replace String — offset",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The existing UTF-8 literal-search target reports replacement count and the offset in the resulting String. Omitted replacement deletes a match. This version rejects empty searches and invalid UTF-8 offsets with ordinary error 1; Unicode case-folding is an explicit unavailable-provider diagnostic.\n\nThe existing UTF-8 literal-search target reports replacement count and the offset in the resulting String. Omitted replacement deletes a match. This version rejects empty searches and invalid UTF-8 offsets with ordinary error 1; Unicode case-folding is an explicit unavailable-provider diagnostic.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.string.search_replace.v1.\nExpected:\ntext-result (string) = \"red blue\"\ncount-result (i32) = 1\noffset-result (i32) = 8\nerror-status (bool) = false\nerror-code (i32) = 0\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["typed", "deterministic", "string", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
  },
